Modifications
-------------

This repository is a fork of middlewarehq/middleware maintained by Clustox.

  Fork:       https://github.com/Clustox/middleware
  Fork point: commit 844eb42 on branch main

Modifications made by Clustox are marked in source files with `CLUSTOX:`
sentinel comments. The complete set of modifications can be listed with:

    grep -rn "CLUSTOX:" --include='*.py' --include='*.ts' --include='*.tsx' \
      --include='*.sql' . | grep -v node_modules

and the full diff from the fork point with:

    git diff 844eb42..main

See docs/FORK_STRATEGY.md for how this fork is maintained.


